From: Dinolek <git@dinolek.me>
Date: Thu, 26 Jun 2025 13:11:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 083/115] Input: novatek-nvt-ts - convert to regmap API

In preparation for SPI support, convert the Novatek NVT touchscreen
driver to use the regmap API.

Signed-off-by: Dinolek <git@dinolek.me>
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/Kconfig             |  16 +-
 drivers/input/touchscreen/Makefile            |   3 +-
 ...novatek-nvt-ts.c => novatek-nvt-ts-core.c} | 156 ++++--------------
 .../input/touchscreen/novatek-nvt-ts-i2c.c    |  66 ++++++++
 drivers/input/touchscreen/novatek-nvt-ts.h    |  54 ++++++
 5 files changed, 164 insertions(+), 131 deletions(-)
 rename drivers/input/touchscreen/{novatek-nvt-ts.c => novatek-nvt-ts-core.c} (59%)
 create mode 100644 drivers/input/touchscreen/novatek-nvt-ts-i2c.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/input/touchscreen/novatek-nvt-ts.h

